Week 2 Data Note — Ibadan North LGA (LST & LULC Project)

Project: Land Surface Temperature (LST) Dynamics of Ibadan North LGA

 1. Ibadan North LGA Boundary

Source: Nigeria GeoData Portal (OCHA HDX). Nigeria administrative boundaries, admin level 2 (LGA), part of the COD-AB (Common Operational Dataset)
Direct link: https://data.humdata.org/dataset/cod-ab-nga

Feature count (1 POLYGON)
Geometry type: Polygon
Key columns:
  ADM2_EN / LGA name: Ibadan North
  ADM2_PCODE: unique P-code identifying the LGA 
  ADM1_EN (State):  "Oyo"
CRS (original / reprojected to): EPSG:4326 (WGS 84) to EPSG:32631 (UTM Zone 31N)
Gaps / issues noticed: Nil
 
2. OSM Buildings (building=*)

Source: OpenStreetMap, via QuickOSM (QGIS plugin)
Query used: building = * within Ibadan North extent

Geometry type: Polygon
Key columns:
  building (type: residential, commercial, yes, etc.): building type/use tag
  name: building name, where tagged
  addr:* tags: address components (housenumber, street, etc.), where tagged
Gaps / issues noticed:
  Many features are likely tagged generic building=yes with no subtype
  Sparse addr:* completion is typical for Nigerian OSM data
 

 3. OSM Land Use (landuse=*)

Source: OpenStreetMap, via QuickOSM
Query used: landuse = * within Ibadan North extent

Geometry type: Polygon
Key columns:
  landuse (residential, commercial, institutional, industrial, etc.): primary land use classification
  name: named land use area, where tagged
Gaps / issues noticed:
  Tagging density is likely uneven between neighborhoods (older, well-mapped areas vs. newer or informal settlements)
  Worth checking completeness of University of Ibadan campus tagging specifically, since it's a large, distinct land use zone within the LGA

4. OSM Natural / Green Space (natural=*, leisure=park)

Source: OpenStreetMap, via QuickOSM
Query used: natural = * and leisure = park within Ibadan North extent

Geometry type: Point / Polygon 
Key columns:
  natural (wood, scrub, water, etc.): natural feature classification
  leisure: recreational green space tag (e.g. park)
  name: feature name, where tagged

Gaps / issues noticed: nil
 
